# STRIDE DFD: checkout data crosses merchant, payment-gateway, and processor trust zones to token and audit stores.
threatmodel "Payment Processing STRIDE"
external Shopper: Online Shopper
external Acquirer: Card Acquirer
process Checkout: Merchant Checkout
process Gateway: Payment Gateway
datastore Tokens: Payment Token Store
datastore Audit: Payment Audit Log
Shopper -> Checkout : checkout request
Checkout -> Gateway : payment authorization
Gateway -> Acquirer : card authorization
Gateway -> Tokens : token lookup
Gateway -> Audit : payment event
Checkout -> Audit : order event
boundary "Public Internet" { Shopper, Acquirer }
boundary "Merchant" { Checkout }
boundary "PCI Zone" { Gateway, Tokens, Audit }
